  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=HY-AM: If you allow access, people using this device will be able to choose if their apps have access to read text messages by using the setting on this page. Denying access blocks apps from reading messages.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_SystemGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=HY-AM: Messaging access
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_SystemGlobal_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=HY-AM: Anyone using this device can choose if their apps have access to read text messages with a cellular connection when this is on
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_AppList_Group\DisplayName:
